{"id":10953,"date":"2022-07-26T13:10:51","date_gmt":"2022-07-26T13:10:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=10953"},"modified":"2022-07-26T13:11:29","modified_gmt":"2022-07-26T13:11:29","slug":"nano-ftir-analyza-chondruli","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/nano-ftir-analyza-chondruli\/","title":{"rendered":"Nano-FTIR: Anal\u00fdza chondrul\u00ed"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>FT-IR spektroskopie se ji\u017e tradi\u010dn\u011b vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 p\u0159i stanoven\u00ed chemick\u00e9ho slo\u017een\u00ed hornin a miner\u00e1l\u016f. Jej\u00ed aplikace se pohybuj\u00ed od anal\u00fdzy pr\u00e1\u0161kov\u00fdch vzork\u016f a\u017e po mapov\u00e1n\u00ed v\u011bt\u0161\u00edch ploch \u0159ez\u016f pomoc\u00ed imagingov\u00e9 spektroskopie. Proto nen\u00ed divu, \u017ee je pro geologick\u00e9 vzorky vhodn\u00e1 i metoda nano-FTIR.<\/p>\n<p>Mezi nejzaj\u00edmav\u011bj\u0161\u00ed geologick\u00e9 vzorky pat\u0159\u00ed bezpochyby chondrule. Jedn\u00e1 se o kamenn\u00e9 meteority obsahuj\u00edc\u00ed zrnka roztaven\u00fdch miner\u00e1l\u016f, kter\u00e9 vznikly v\u00a0dob\u011b, kdy vznikala i na\u0161e slune\u010dn\u00ed soustava, jsou tedy velmi d\u016fle\u017eit\u00fdmi sv\u011bdky na\u0161eho slune\u010dn\u00edho syst\u00e9mu a mohou n\u00e1m napov\u011bd\u011bt, jak\u00e9 podm\u00ednky zde v\u00a0dob\u011b jeho vzniku panovaly.<\/p>\n<p>Krom\u011b p\u0159esn\u00e9ho stanoven\u00ed anorganick\u00fdch slo\u017eek chondrul\u00ed je nano-FTIR u\u017eite\u010dn\u00fdm n\u00e1strojem i v\u00a0p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b jejich organick\u00fdch slo\u017eek. Takov\u00e1 zji\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed jsou z\u00e1sadn\u00ed mimo jin\u00e9 pro v\u00fdzkum teori\u00ed o vzniku \u017eivota na Zemi.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_10957\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-10957\" style=\"width: 600px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-10957\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/b203c59d-300x115.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"230\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/b203c59d-300x115.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/b203c59d-1024x393.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/b203c59d-768x295.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/b203c59d-1536x590.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/b203c59d.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-10957\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">(a) Chemick\u00e1 mapa vzorku chondrule nam\u011b\u0159en\u00e1 pomoc\u00ed micro-FTIR p\u0159elo\u017een\u00e1 p\u0159es mozaiku z\u00edskanou metodou m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed reflektance, (b) FT-IR spektra hlavn\u00edch slo\u017eek vzorku<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_10960\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-10960\" style=\"width: 600px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-10960\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/30c974ad-300x268.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"536\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/30c974ad-300x268.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/30c974ad-1024x915.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/30c974ad-768x686.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/30c974ad.jpg 1311w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-10960\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Chemick\u00e1 mapa vybran\u00e9 oblasti vzorku. Jednotliv\u00e9 barevn\u00e9 kan\u00e1ly (zelen\u00e1, modr\u00e1, \u010derven\u00e1) reprezentuj\u00ed pom\u011brn\u00e9 zastoupen\u00ed r\u016fzn\u00fdch slo\u017eek podle spektr\u00e1ln\u00edch p\u00e1s\u016f 944, 1039 a 1081 cm-1<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_10962\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-10962\" style=\"width: 600px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-10962\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/8a7054ca-300x124.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"248\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/8a7054ca-300x124.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/8a7054ca-1024x423.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/8a7054ca-768x317.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/8a7054ca-1536x634.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/07\/8a7054ca.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-10962\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Nano-FTIR spektra: (a) amplituda a (b) f\u00e1ze oblasti z\u00e1jmu na jemnozrn\u00e9m vzorku. Tato spektra mohou o vzorku podat dal\u0161\u00ed sadu informac\u00ed, kter\u00e9 bychom pomoc\u00ed klasick\u00e9 FT-IR spektroskopie nez\u00edskali.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>FT-IR spektroskopie se ji\u017e tradi\u010dn\u011b vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 p\u0159i stanoven\u00ed chemick\u00e9ho slo\u017een\u00ed hornin a miner\u00e1l\u016f. Jej\u00ed aplikace se pohybuj\u00ed od anal\u00fdzy pr\u00e1\u0161kov\u00fdch vzork\u016f a\u017e po mapov\u00e1n\u00ed v\u011bt\u0161\u00edch ploch \u0159ez\u016f pomoc\u00ed imagingov\u00e9 spektroskopie. Proto nen\u00ed divu, \u017ee je pro geologick\u00e9 vzorky vhodn\u00e1 i metoda nano-FTIR. Mezi nejzaj\u00edmav\u011bj\u0161\u00ed geologick\u00e9 vzorky pat\u0159\u00ed bezpochyby chondrule. Jedn\u00e1 se o kamenn\u00e9 meteority obsahuj\u00edc\u00ed [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":10955,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[75,109,9],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-10953","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-75","category-109","category-n